	quest.2C38A00645CD3F3E.quest_desc: ["Use the anvil to shape the metal. The ingot MUST be hot to be moulded and you will need a hammer to mould the metal into the chosen shape. Left-click the top of the anvil several times with a smithing hammer while the strike indicator is full to finish the process. If the part cools down before you have finished modelling, you have to put it back into the forge in heating mode (1 or 0 bellows). If you get a hot piece, right-click on a cauldron with water to cool the piece. Some components can only be obtained with other types of anvils."]
	quest.2E971FC3E0B637A6.title: "Clay"
	quest.2F4F058465393143.title: "Grass Block"
	quest.3140A1C625E72C2A.quest_desc: ["Break a log while holding \"shift\" to cut down whole tree."]
	quest.32EE176E7612E979.quest_desc: ["Craft a campfire to perform basic smelting. Use it to smelt clay into bricks. Check EMI to know how to craft clay blocks."]
	quest.36B4722DC6A618C1.title: "Venison"
	quest.3730D661E94D6CE7.title: "Silver to Gold"
	quest.39C8C2B8EAC69928.title: "Basalt"
	quest.3A06D5B647A9889F.title: "Leek"
	quest.3B0666F0E20B3E38.title: "Honeycomb"
	quest.3C09F6D93F56E7FF.quest_desc: ["Shift-right click a grindstone with a weapon to sharpen it. A sharpened weapon will do increades damage for 32 usages."]
	quest.3C453397BE48DA55.quest_desc: ["Horses can be stored in a horse pouch after you saddle them,"]
	quest.3C453397BE48DA55.title: "Horses"
	quest.40AA2AF5DBF92CE5.title: "Lead"
	quest.4395119F33853859.quest_desc: ["Use the artisan table to combine different parts in the tool or piece of armour. Right-click the artisan table in the EMI menu to see which items to create."]
	quest.46DC0AEBD01A893C.title: "Warp Stone"
	quest.4820E62F05D9DEAE.title: "Beetroot"
	quest.488CDCB1D77D1EC5.quest_desc: ["Use the forge to acquire metal smelting. Right-click the forge from EMI to see the possible recipes. In order for it to work, you will need two bellows attached to it, which must also be activated. Once a metal is smelted, you can extract it from the forge GUI and place it on a treated anvil"]
