	quest.60E9F174F531FC64.quest_desc: ["Use /sethome to set your home. Then use /home to teleport to the location you chose as home. Use /back to teleport to the previous location. Use /tpa to teleport to a chosen player position. Keep in mind that these commands have a cooldown."]
	quest.60F62781F0B1B8BA.title: "Purpur Block"
	quest.613391B216694E52.title: "Rabbit"
	quest.6152E4D5B46ED57A.quest_desc: ["Hammers and excavators will break blocks in a 3x3 block area, thus reducing the time lost in obtaining resources or terraforming. Search for ‘@onlyhammers’ in the EMI menu to find out which items have these functions."]
	quest.61F5E5FF8190E084.title: "Bamboo"
	quest.652E46F508A592AB.quest_desc: ["You can repair an anvil by right-clicking on it while holding an iron block. Renaming items is free, while repairing them has a fixed cost that does not depend on the number of repairs already carried out."]
